  "We share your personal data with trusted third-party service providers who assist us in operating the Platform, including the authentication provider for identity verification and sign-in, our hosting provider for data storage and infrastructure, our email provider for sending results and marketing emails, our messaging provider for sending OTPs and notifications, and our payment processor for processing Subscription Fees. These service providers are bound by contractual obligations no less restrictive than those set out in this Privacy Policy and are permitted to process your personal data only for the purposes we specify.",
  "We may disclose your personal data if required to do so by law, regulation, or court order, or if we believe in good faith that such disclosure is necessary to comply with a legal obligation, to protect and defend our rights or property, to prevent or investigate possible wrongdoing in connection with the Platform, or to protect the personal safety of users of the Platform or the public.",
  "We may share Aggregated Data with third parties for analytics, reporting, and improving the Platform, but Aggregated Data does not contain any information that could identify you. We do not share your Personal Data with any third party for the purpose of marketing or advertising, and we do not permit any third party to use your Personal Data for its own purposes except to the extent necessary for the third party to provide the services that we have engaged it to provide.",
  "Where we engage a Data Processor, we enter into a written contract with the Data Processor that requires the Data Processor to process Personal Data only on our instructions, to implement appropriate technical and organisational security measures, to assist us in complying with our obligations under the DPDP Act, to notify us in the event of a Personal Data Breach, and to delete or return Personal Data to us at the end of the provision of services, subject to any legal requirement to retain it.",
  "We retain your personal data only for as long as necessary to fulfil the purposes for which it was collected.",
  "Your name, email address, account identifier, IP address, and user agent are retained for twelve (12) months after the last time you used the Platform, and then cleared.",
