  "You have the right to withdraw your consent to the processing of your personal data at any time, and upon such withdrawal, we shall cease processing your personal data and shall delete or anonymise such data from our own systems, subject to any applicable legal or regulatory requirements, and subject to the retention periods applicable to Anthropic PBC as described in this Privacy Policy. You have the right to request the deletion of your personal data, and we shall remove the identifying fields from our systems and shall instruct Anthropic PBC to do the same, to the extent technically possible.",
