  "If part of this Privacy Policy is found to be invalid or unenforceable, the rest of it continues to apply, and DataDost will replace the affected part with a valid provision describing the same practice.",
  "This Privacy Policy is issued under, and is to be read in accordance with, the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, the Digital Personal Data Protection Rules, 2025, and the other laws in force in India which apply to it. This Privacy Policy is a notice given by DataDost of what it does with your personal data. It is not a contract, it creates no obligations on you, and nothing in it requires your agreement in order to take effect.",
  "If you are dissatisfied with any aspect of this Privacy Policy or with the manner in which DataDost processes your Personal Data, you should write to the Data Protection Officer at privacy@datadost.in, marking your message \"Grievance\", or to the Grievance Officer at grievance@datadost.in. Your complaint will be acknowledged within two (2) business days and we will use our best efforts to resolve it within fifteen (15) business days of receipt. If you are not satisfied with the outcome, you may take the matter to the Data Protection Board of India. Nothing in this Privacy Policy limits, delays or conditions your right to do so, or any other right or remedy available to you in law.",
  "Acknowledgement of this Privacy Policy is signified by you ticking the consent box presented on screen before sign-in, having been given access to the full text of this Privacy Policy. The same tick by which you agree to the Terms of Service and the User Data Processing Consent, and by which you confirm that you are 18 or over, also constitutes your acknowledgement of this Privacy Policy. No other act constitutes acknowledgement.",
  "This Privacy Policy may be amended by DataDost from time to time, and a materially amended Privacy Policy shall be presented for acknowledgement at your next sign-in. DataDost shall give you at least fifteen (15) days' prior notice of any material changes to this Privacy Policy through the Platform or by email to your registered email address. You acknowledge and agree that it is your sole responsibility to review this Privacy Policy periodically for any changes, and your acknowledgement of the amended Privacy Policy at the next sign-in shall constitute your acknowledgement of the amended Privacy Policy. If you do not accept the amended Privacy Policy, you shall cease all use of the Platform.",
